{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>עדינה.</b> An adjective form, from the paradigm of היתה לי עדנה (Genesis 18:12):" "<b>ואפסי.</b> The yod is added as an addition, like the yod of מני אפרי (Judges 5:14):" "<b>[אלמנה].</b> The husband is the king:" "<b>שכול.</b> A noun on the pattern of דק in דק בכפור (Exodus 16:14), חרב שפוט (II Chronicles 20:9):"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 47, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:58:24.921427055Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}